+  // web#12: rig-miss telemetry. LocateViewsForRect answers EMPTY on five
+  // distinct exits and the renderer consumes the answer every animation frame,
+  // so an empty answer used to be worth one mono (visibly dark) frame in a
+  // side-by-side scene tile. The renderer now latches the last-good views over
